      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with this, however, I do think it's really tough for them to get something like this right. The potential for security issues is huge, but, it's better than the current modded clients people obviously!\nI think a lot of the things people use modded clients for are simply things that should be a feature request, mainly additional favourite avatars and a social refresh button.\nHowever, it's worth noting a social refresh button would drastically increase API calls. As per the usage agreement for VRChat's API, you agree to only call it once every 60 seconds if I recall, though social right now really doesn't refresh every 60 seconds, or at least it doesn't feel like it does... :)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
