  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-04-04T15:46:59.077Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know mods are against the TOS, but if devs include an official mod api, people who just want some features not present in vrc (like a refresh button in social tab) would not have to violate terms of service and be put in the same group of people ass forcekickers etc. an official sdk also means that the devs would have full control over what's editable and what's not and obfuscate the rest of the code to make illegal modding even harder.\nMoreover, having an official modding api would remove the need for 3rd party mod loader and make them obsolete, leaving malicious modders with no mod loader to load the hack.",
